The composite output of : everything the downstream candidate source and generation handler need about one user's taste, in one shot. It carries the prompt-shaped (which intentionally holds no TMDB ids — it is titles/genres/ratings only, §12) plus the TMDB keys the grounded fan-out and the hallucination guard require:
— the highest-rated titles' (TmdbId, Media), seeds for the "more like this" recommendation fan-out (ADR 0017 §1);
— the same favorite genres' TMDB ids, for the discover fan-out;
— every (TmdbId, Media) the user reviewed or watchlisted, removed from candidates so a recommendation is always a NEW title;
— false for a cold-start user (no reviews and no watchlist), letting the handler skip the model entirely (§5.1).
Application-owned; never a vendor or TMDB DTO.
